WEBVTT

00:00:00.688 --> 00:00:04.448
How naimix is organised.

00:00:04.448 --> 00:00:15.259
Four building blocks.

00:00:15.259 --> 00:00:20.228
The input says what the caller sends; the backend says where to go.

00:00:20.228 --> 00:00:26.445
The output maps backend fields into your own JSON.

00:00:26.445 --> 00:00:36.606
Raw backend response, then what naimix returns.
